## Reading room

::bg{location="library" time="night"}
@archivist{emotion="grim"}: You are not in my catalogue. Everything that comes down here is in my catalogue.
@ilo: Then write me in.
@archivist: I have. Under "drowned". The ink is still wet.
@narrator: The Archivist folds in on itself like a closing book, and the shelves go still.
